        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle SO DO KIEN TRUC HE THONG\n\ntop to bottom direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor #000000\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontColor #E5E7EB\nskinparam ArrowColor #D1D5DB\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.5\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam roundCorner 12\n\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BorderColor #202938\n    FontColor #E5E7EB\n    FontSize 14\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\nskinparam package {\n    BorderColor #202938\n    FontColor #E5E7EB\n    FontSize 15\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\nskinparam database {\n    BorderColor #4A3B0B\n    BackgroundColor #191300\n    FontColor #E5E7EB\n}\n\n&#39; =====================================\n&#39; FRONTEND\n&#39; =====================================\n\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Frontend – React&lt;/b&gt;\\nGiao diện danh sách / chi tiết / tiếp nhận khảo sát\&quot; as FE #08111F\n\n&#39; =====================================\n&#39; BACKEND\n&#39; =====================================\n\npackage \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Backend – Flask&lt;/b&gt;\&quot; as BE #001A12 {\n\n    together {\n        rectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Routes&lt;/b&gt;\\nNhận request\&quot; as ROUTES #08111F\n\n        rectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Services&lt;/b&gt;\\nXử lý nghiệp vụ\&quot; as SERVICES #08111F\n\n        rectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Repositories&lt;/b&gt;\\nTruy vấn dữ liệu\&quot; as REPOS #08111F\n    }\n\n    ROUTES -right[hidden]-&gt; SERVICES\n    SERVICES -right[hidden]-&gt; REPOS\n\n    ROUTES --&gt; SERVICES\n    SERVICES --&gt; REPOS\n}\n\n&#39; =====================================\n&#39; DATABASE\n&#39; =====================================\n\ndatabase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;PostgreSQL Database&lt;/b&gt;\\nLưu trữ dữ liệu hệ thống\&quot; as DB\n\n&#39; =====================================\n&#39; CONNECTIONS\n&#39; =====================================\n\nFE -down-&gt; BE : HTTP Request / REST API\n\nBE -down-&gt; DB\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="whHCf49WS-qFSYS4wGri-1">
